# NOTICE — vendored webfonts (Increment 4: font menu)

Lexend is NOT listed here: it was already vendored before this increment and
its provenance is recorded in FONTS.md alongside the other pre-existing assets.

Its @font-face blocks did live in assets/css/app.css; this increment MOVED all
six (Lexend, Lexend Giga, Lexend Deca × latin/latin-ext) into assets/css/fonts.css
so that every family the menu offers is declared in exactly one file. app.css
now carries no @font-face at all — only a pointer comment. The twelve faces in
fonts.css are the complete set: four menu families, six css families, two
subsets each.

